{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared dice-grammar conformance vectors. Consumed verbatim by the app's roller",
    "and by the pack builder's validator; neither owns this file. See",
    "docs/08-capabilities-spec.md section 4 and docs/00-pack-schema.md section 6.",
    "",
    "Every entry in 'unparseable' must be unparseable under the pinned EBNF, not",
    "merely unusual. d100 and d%+1 were previously listed here and are not: d100 is",
    "dS with S=100 and d%+1 is form followed by modifier. An implementer following",
    "the grammar would have failed the vectors, and one following the vectors would",
    "have implemented restrictions the format never states -- the exact cross-language",
    "disagreement this file exists to prevent.",
    "",
    "Probabilities are exact rationals so 2d6 and d11+1 are distinguishable by",
    "equality rather than by a confidence interval. Compute NdS by convolution:",
    "10d10 has 10^10 outcomes, so enumeration is not an option and a sampling test",
    "would flake -- and a suite that flakes gets disabled.",
    "",
    "'draws' are zero-based uniform integers in [0, S); face = draw + 1. They pin",
    "that NdS draws N times in order, rather than once over the whole range."
  ],
